# League Rematch Chamber — Elite Four (L74-77) and Champion Celeste (L78-80). Tagged powerspot: every gimmick works.
# Leaving the chamber resets the gauntlet (onenter clears the per-visit flags).
map champions_hall_league
name "Rematch Chamber"
location "Coral Isles"
music league_hall
environment building
indoor
onenter p3c_league_enter
tags powerspot gym

layout
